'''Bonding''' measures how fond a monster is of its owner. It ranges between 0 and 100. 

A monster gains 1 bond for every 1,000 [[Steps]] taken, and loses 10 bond every time it faints in battle.

A newly-captured or traded monster has a Bond of 25. 

The bonding mechanics need to be activated for each campaign, by giving the [[Friendship Scroll]] to the player. 

On a tuxemon's info page, their level of bond is shown with an icon:
[[File:Bond-Sheet.png]]

=== Ideas ===

* Bond is not displayed, but a general sentence is: "X despises [player name]" (Bond 0-20), "X is wary of [player name]" (Bond 21-50), "X gets along with [player name]" (Bond 51-75), "X adores [player name]" (Bond 76-100). 
* Items that improve or worsen Bond
* Mini-games you can play with your monsters to improve their Bond